    "14160fa4-fce1-42cf-bc77-991af5e39765": {
      "filters": null,
      "name": "The steep gorge, before and after",
      "parameters": {
        "bearing": null,
        "content": {
          "attachments": {},
          "contentMode": "markdown",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**Timure and Rasuwagadhi: the same six kilometre square, before the flood and\nafter it.**\n\n![Timure and Rasuwagadhi, before and after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arjxn-py/nepal-flood-26-aug/main/data/nepal-flood-2026-review/fig-before-after-red.png)\n\nA thin line of water through forest became bare rock and gravel, from one valley\nwall to the other. The village went with the bank it stood on.\n\nGrey means no satellite got a clear look in the days after. Every pass was 70 to\n90 per cent cloud. So each picture is built from the clear pixels of several\npasses. That is true of every picture after this one too.\n",
          "paneAlignment": "start",
          "panelWidth": "52%"
        },
        "enableIdentify": false,
        "extent": [
          9503278.137327287,
          3281629.2665943666,
          9503278.137327287,
          3281629.2665943666
