          "contentMode": "map",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "markdown": "**15:20. Devghat, 189 km down, 6 h 43 min after the slope gave way.**\n\nIt peaked here about an hour later, at some 5,850 m\u00b3/s. Looking back up the valley, the blue line runs all the way to the slope.\n",
